# Rule V2: a line that is not JSON, and a first message that is not hello, are answered with bye malformed and a close.
# WC 3.5: the pane treats bye malformed like bye protocol.
! open
C this line is not json
D {"t":"bye","why":"malformed","protocol":1,"version":"9.9.9"}
! state version-mismatch
! close daemon
! wait 30000
! open
C {"t":"ping"}
D {"t":"bye","why":"malformed","protocol":1,"version":"9.9.9"}
! state version-mismatch
! close daemon
